---
import { ProsePage } from '../components/prose-page.tsx';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/base-layout.astro';

// Draft. Have it reviewed before launch and keep it in sync with what the site actually loads.
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy" description="How backbricks.app handles your data.">
  <ProsePage title="Privacy policy">
    <p>
      This website is a static information page. It uses no cookies, no analytics, no tracking and
      no third-party scripts or fonts. You can't submit any data on it.
    </p>
    <h2>Controller</h2>
    <p>The controller is the operator named in the <a href="/imprint">imprint</a>.</p>
    <h2>Hosting</h2>
    <p>
      The site is hosted by Vercel Inc., 440 N Barranca Ave #4133, Covina, CA 91723, USA. When you
      open a page, Vercel processes technical data your browser sends (such as IP address, date
      and time, page requested, browser and operating system) to deliver the site and keep it
      secure. The legal basis is our legitimate interest in a reliable, secure website (Art. 6 (1)
      (f) GDPR). Vercel acts as our processor under a data processing agreement; transfers to the
      USA rely on the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework and standard contractual clauses.
    </p>
    <h2>External links</h2>
    <p>
      Links to GitHub open GitHub's website, which has its own privacy policy. No data is sent to
      GitHub until you follow such a link.
    </p>
    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data
      portability and objection (Art. 15–21 GDPR), and the right to lodge a complaint with a
      supervisory authority. To exercise them, contact us using the details in the imprint.
    </p>
  </ProsePage>
</BaseLayout>
